Package: HuEmProjection
Type: Package
Title: Human Early Embryo Reference Projection
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Cheng", "Zhao", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "cheng.zhao@example.com")
Author: Cheng Zhao
Maintainer: Cheng Zhao <cheng.zhao@example.com>
Description: Offline projection of query single-cell gene expression matrices
    onto a stable human early embryo reference, with UMAP projection, SVM-based
    cell identity prediction, Milo neighbourhood aggregation, and pseudotime
    transfer.
